props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["追加の費用はかかりません。植物油はもともと多くの家庭の主力です。難しいのは、料理やご飯にラードを使う味の習慣を変えることです。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Cochraneは、15件のランダム化比較試験、計56,675人を対象に、各試験の期間が少なくとも2年間にわたるデータを集計しました。飽和脂肪酸の摂取を減らすことで、心血管イベントの合計は、約17%減少しました（RR 0.83、0.70–0.98）。全死亡率（RR 0.96、0.90–1.03）および心血管死（RR 0.95、0.80–1.12）に変化は見られませんでした。多価不飽和脂肪酸（大豆油やコーン油の主成分）への置換、および炭水化物への置換については、効果に差は認められませんでした。一価不飽和脂肪酸（キャノーラ油やオリーブ油の主成分）への置換については、データが不十分であり、結論を出すことはできません。別のコクラン・レビュー（19件のランダム化比較試験、6461人対象）では、オメガ-6（リノール酸）の摂取増加は、全死亡率のRR 1.00（0.88–1.12）、心血管イベントのRR 0.97（0.81–1.15）であり、益も害も認められませんでした。3件目のレビュー（86件のランダム化比較試験、162,796人対象）では、植物由来のオメガ-3（亜麻仁油やえごま油の主要成分）の摂取増加は、全死亡率のRR 1.01（0.84–1.20）、冠動脈疾患イベントのRR 1.00（0.82–1.22）であり、ほとんど効果がありませんでした。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Hooper L, Martin N, Jimoh OF, 等 (2020). Reduction in saturated fat for cardiovascular disease. Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews, (5), CD011737. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD011737.pub3","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD011737.pub3"]},"；Hooper L, Al-Khudairy L, Abdelhamid AS, 等 (2018). Omega-6 fats for the primary and secondary prevention of cardiovascular disease. Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews, (11), CD011094. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD011094.pub4","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD011094.pub4"]},"；Abdelhamid AS, Brown TJ, Brainard JS, 等 (2020). Omega-3 fatty acids for the primary and secondary prevention of cardiovascular disease. Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews, (3), CD003177. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD003177.pub5","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD003177.pub5"]},"；中国营养学会 (2022). 中国居民膳食指南（2022）. 人民卫生出版社"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD011737.pub3","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["論争：大豆油やコーン油に含まれるオメガ-6 が多すぎると炎症を促進するため、摂取を控えて油を切り替えるべきだと主張する人がいます。上記のオメガ-6 に関する論文のランダム化比較試験では害は見られませんでしたが、エビデンスの質は著者による自己評価で「低」とされています。ベネフィットの規模は、心血管イベントの低 17% 減少に基づき「中」と設定されていますが、全死亡率は変化しませんでした。どの油であっても使用量はコントロールする必要があります。食事ガイドラインでは、1人1日あたりの調理用油を 25 から 30 グラムと推奨しています。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/02-40"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"包装済みでSC番号がある食用油を購入すること。小規模な手作り・バラ売りのピーナッツ油は避ける"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/02-42"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"炒め物や揚げ物の際は換気扇を回すこと。火をつけた瞬間から料理が終わるまで。"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["このテーマの他の提案"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-36"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["条件が許すなら入浴を、シャワーだけで済ませない"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["ほぼ毎日入浴する人は、週に2回未満の人に比べて、心血管イベントのリスクが約 28% 低く、脳出血のリスクが約 46% 低くなります。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-37"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["昼寝は30分以内に抑えること。1時間を超えないように。1〜2時間寝ないと持ちこたえられない場合は原因を調べること"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["昼寝が1時間を超えない人は、死亡および慢性疾患のリスクは上昇せず、脳の覚醒度もより高まります。1時間を超える睡眠をとる人は、冠動脈疾患のリ…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-38"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["徹夜明けの翌晩には睡眠を補うこと。週末まで溜め込まない"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["睡眠不足の翌晩に睡眠を補えなかった人は、規則正しい生活の人に比べて死亡リスクが約 15% 高く、大幅に睡眠不足な上、補えなかった人のリスク…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-39"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["夜勤の期間が長いほど心血管リスクは高まる。配置転換ができるなら早めに検討を"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["夜勤に従事する人は、そうでない人に比べて心血管疾患が約 13% 多く、心血管死は約 27% 多いです。しかも、期間が長くなるほどリスクは増…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-43"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["閉経前後のほてりや寝汗が生活に支障をきたすなら、婦人科でホルモン療法の評価を受ける。我慢せず、自己判断で薬を買わず、心臓病予防にも使わない"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["閉経前後のほてりや寝汗にホルモン療法を使うと、ほてりの回数はプラセボより約75%少なくなります。一方で、乳がん、血栓、脳卒中は少し増え、そ…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-44"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["もともと犬を飼いたい人は毎日の散歩を歩行量に含める。長生きだけを目的に飼わない"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["犬を飼う人は同じ期間に死亡する確率が平均約4分の1低く、心筋梗塞や脳卒中後では差がさらに大きい研究があります。ただし他の違いを調整すると、…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/ja/book/02"},"children":["テーマ全体を読む：ゆっくり死なないために"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"メインナビゲーション"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/ja/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"pat